  "projects": [
   {
    "title": "GOAP Simulation",
    "description": "GOAP Simulation is a simulation of the Goal Oriented Action Planning system by Jeff Orkin based originally off the STRIPS (Stanford Research Institute Problem Solver) architecture implemented in a video game setting towards game AI.\n\nThis project was a second semester Senior year solo project to explore and expand my knowledge of AI in games and showcasing that I am capable of implementing a modern day game AI system that has the potential to scale with larger game projects. This project was implemented in Unreal Engine 4 using a combination of C++ and the engine's custom blueprint system.\n\nResponsibilities:\n- Researched and Implemented Jeff Orkin's Goal Oriented Action Planning AI system in Unreal Engine 4 C++.\n- Utilized the UE4 navigation system for AI pathfinding.\n- Implemented Tasks for the AI to complete using a simple state-machine for them to process their goals once planned using the GOAP system.",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jan 2022 - Apr 2022"
   },
   {
    "title": "Homeward Bound",
    "description": "Homeward Bound is a top down wave defense game where the player needs to work with their 3 companions to defend a portal from being invaded from evil monsters.\n\nThis project was a first semester Senior year project at DigiPen Institute of Technology created with a team of 2 other programmers and 1 designer using the Godot game engine.\n\nThis project was originally going to be networked and we supported networking through a peer to peer connection halfway through the project until it was dropped to focus on making a complete experience by the end of the semester.\n\nResponsibilities:\n- Design and Implement Behavior Trees into Godot from scratch in their custom scripting\nlanguage GDScript, since they do not have Behavior Trees in engine. Greatly increasing\nbehavior creation and iteration speed.\n- Used Behavior Trees to implement Companion AI that identify optimal areas of the map to defend.\n- Worked in a networked environment being conscious of what data to send/sync between players to create the smoothest experience possible.",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Sep 2021 - Dec 2021"
   }
